# Settings' fourth knob, Voices (0.14.12): DY swaps the thirty built-in DX voices for the human-made set. The pluck on a DX voice plays on
# through the switch (the engine loads the other set's patch between chunks), the setting is read back, the Pluck page names the DY voice,
# and the switch back works.
seed 0
wait 500
setpar 98 80
setpar 99 12
wait 1000
press HOME
wait 900
release HOME
wait 100
expect fxpage 18
expect dyvoices 0
spin K4 1
wait 100
expect dyvoices 1
peakreset
wait 4000
expect peak_db_min -40
shot dyvoices.png
# the Pluck page: its Sound reads DY TINE EP (the ARP cycle from the settings page)
tap ARP
tap ARP
tap ARP
tap ARP
tap ARP
tap ARP
wait 300
expect view 14
shot dyvoices_pluck.png
press HOME
wait 900
release HOME
wait 100
expect fxpage 18
spin K4 -1
wait 100
expect dyvoices 0
peakreset
wait 4000
expect peak_db_min -40
